:: Isabel - secret meeting 1 [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHTCLUB WC</h1>
<br />

The bathroom was empty when you walked in — empty except for the woman leaning against the far wall, arms crossed, watching the door.

<br /><br />

<center>
	<<image 'people/isabel/intro.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

<<isabel>>
	You came. Good. That tells me something about you already.
<</isabel>>
<br />

You asked who she was.

<br /><br />

<<isabel>>
	Dom's wife. For now, at least. I've seen you around — heard about the deal he offered you, and heard you turned him down. Not many people do that and stay breathing.
<</isabel>>
<br />
<<isabel>>
	I'm not here to talk about caps or territory. I'm here because I'm tired of watching my husband decide who lives comfortably and who doesn't, and I think you might actually have a spine.
<</isabel>>
<br />

She studied you for a long moment, like she was deciding how much to risk saying out loud.

<br /><br />

<<isabel>>
	I'm not going to say more tonight. This place has ears. But if you're willing to listen, come back. Same place.
<</isabel>>
<br />

She slipped past you and was gone before you could ask anything else.

<br /><br />

<<set $characters.isabel.quests.secret_meeting1_day = $game.day>>

<<link 'Leave'>>
	<<addmins 10>>
	<<goto 'Nightclub - inside'>>
<</link>>
